      "question": "Does SSDI have a resource limit?",
      "answer": "The SSDI eligibility rules in 20 CFR 404.315 and 20 CFR 404.130 contain no resource limit, meaning your savings, owned vehicles, and personal real estate do not disqualify you from receiving worker disability insurance."
